        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Araya, Marcus Mumford, Ben Lovett, Winston Marshall, Ted Dwane\n- Bands: Slayer, Mumford & Sons\n- Songs: \"Eyes of the Insane\"\n- Roles: vocalist, bassist, lead singer, songwriter, musician, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Tomás Enrique Araya Díaz was born on June 6, 1961.\n- Tom Araya is a Chilean American musician best known as the vocalist and bassist of the American thrash metal band Slayer.\n- Marcus Oliver Johnstone Mumford was born on 31 January 1987.\n- Marcus Mumford is a British-American singer, songwriter, musician, and producer best known as the lead singer of Mumford & Sons.\n- Tom Araya wrote the song \"Eyes of the Insane\" during pre-production for its album.\n- Mumford & Sons consists of Marcus Mumford on lead vocals, electric guitar, acoustic guitar, and drums; Ben Lovett on vocals, keyboard, piano, and synthesizer; Winston Marshall on vocals, electric guitar, and banjo; and Ted Dwane on vocals, bass guitar, and double bass.",
